// tabletop_tool — the Tabletop games tools' work, for the tool presets (tools_builtins/tabletop.json). A command-line program, never reachable over the web.
//
//   php tabletop_tool roll       EXPRESSIONS OUTPUT [seed=N times=N]       roll dice expressions, one per line (2d6+3, 4d6kh3, 2d20kl1, d100, 3d8dl1+1d4-2); a seed makes the rolls repeatable
