//
// Dice: NdM, d20 means 1d20, kh/kl keep the highest/lowest, dh/dl drop the highest/lowest, +/- numbers and several terms. At most 1000 dice of at most 1,000,000 sides. A seed gives the same rolls every time
// (the seed is always printed). Point-buy and required fields are whatever YOU pass: no game system's rules are built in. ENTITIES.csv: name, type (npc, location, item ...), aliases separated by |.
// The originals are never changed. Rolling is fair pseudo-random chance, not a prediction.
// =============================================================================
